## 2026-10-05 14:42
Also! I made a (fairly minor) feature request for one of the official Omeka S plug-in modules, and I got an email the following day that it was implemented and would be going out in the next release. Definitely inspires confidence in the maintenance of the project.

## 2026-10-05 14:41
It took a full day of experimenting, fiddling, and scripting, but I was able to get the entire Ace Archive collection imported into Omeka S, which is rad. The API documentation… leaves a lot to be desired. Maybe when this is all over I rewrite it for them.

## 2026-10-02 15:12
I've decided I'm going to be migrating Ace Archive over to a new backend called Omeka S. It's a collection management system designed for digital archives, whereas currently the Ace Archive backend is a haphazard collection of bespoke services built from scratch. I got it deployed and I've been poking around learning how to use it, and I'm very excited. I'm still going to need to build a layer to bridge Omeka with the way  the site exists currently, if for no other reason so that links don't break. Migrating the existing collection into it is also going to be… fun…

## 2026-09-30 12:49
Damn I remember when having a GitHub account felt cool. I'm slowly working on migrating projects over to Codeberg, but have come to realize how dependent I've become on Microsoft's free CI/CD… which is maybe the point. I self-host my own Forgejo Actions runner to use on Codeberg, but that does unfortunately mean I have no way to test my software on Windows and macOS. GitHub Actions is the only way I was able to do that previously

## 2026-09-28 13:49
I'm trying to design a declarative DSL for defining data pipelines, and it turns out designing a language is *hard*. This project is kicking my ass haha. The goal is to use it for Ace Archive, but I still don't know if it'll actually be worth the effort

## 2026-09-26 13:52
First Anville event back at Fabville for the new school year went very well. About 30 people showed up, including some new faces! As expected I got approximately zero actual work done and had a great time hanging out with my friends instead 💚

